featureVector writes a .FV.txt inventory of the input file's source-located
AST nodes. Entries include node class names, constant values, declaration and
argument types, template arguments, and attached preprocessing information.
Compare inventories when checking a transformation's output. Variant IDs and
hash values are not a substitute for semantic equivalence.

Run `featureVector --help` for tool options. `--verbose` also prints the entries
to standard output. Output-file errors fail the command.
